<div class="chapter_content content" id="7683839_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany 7-18-1983 by L.L. No. 2-1983 as Ch. XVIII of the 1983 Code. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Building construction — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7681109" href="7681109#7681109">133</a>.</div><div class="para">Housing — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7682800" href="7682800#7682800">231</a>.</div><div class="para">Licenses — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7683409" href="7683409#7683409">245</a>.</div><div class="para">Sewers — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7684007" href="7684007#7684007">299</a>.</div><div class="para">Zoning — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="38067105" href="38067105#38067105">375</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


