        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683867" data-guid="7683867"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683867" data-guid="7683867" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683867_content" title-footnotes="1"><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7683867-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7683867-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor’s Note: Former § 261-18, Eligibility for examination, was repealed 10-17-2017 by Ord. No. 49.82.16.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683868"
      id="7683868"
      data-guid="7683868"
      data-position="6304"
      data-full-title="§ 261-19: Repealer."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
